  "geometry": "Five concentric rows of seats about a centre near (297.6, 545); row radii 81.59, 124.81, 167.25, 205.91, 247.68 pt. Arm seats span x ~ 45..207 on the government (left) side and x ~ 368..550 on the opposition (right) side, the outer rows reaching further towards the page edges. The front row's arms extend furthest north toward the Speaker. Seat coordinates below give the surname label's north-west corner in page points, y increasing downward.",
  "ordering": "Within each row, 'seat' numbers run from the northern (Speaker) end of the government side, around the far (south) curve, up to the northern end of the opposition side."
